# To Cure a Cough (sandoria 20) at Amaura beside The Medicine Woman (C#, a container; its Amaura section while
# accepted), DiaryPage 3, no key item of this quest: The Medicine Woman's 636 (Progress) beats the script on every talk
# (option 1: no formula). With Amaura's Formula (GM): its AMAURA_DIALOG_COMEBACK (a message) and the script alternate,
# so this quest's 645 plays on the second talk (the script's call), the message on the third.
char zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=-82.4,-6.9,91.1 job=WAR lvl=30
quest Sandoria.TheMedicineWoman accepted
charvar DiaryPage 3
login
trigger Amaura                            # The Medicine Woman: 636
finish option=1                           # no formula
trigger Amaura                            # 636 again (Progress: no fallback to the script)
finish option=1
keyitem AmaurasFormula
trigger Amaura                            # AMAURA_DIALOG_COMEBACK
finish-if-event
trigger Amaura                            # the script: 645
finish-if-event                           # begun
trigger Amaura                            # AMAURA_DIALOG_COMEBACK
finish-if-event
